≥6个月；筛选及基线时PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3；适合接受系统治疗或光疗。","quote_sha256":"3e9ca06af65f6aeb7e28df97f2a93f40d8966553fa5faff3f806e43f762999dd","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sd_inclusion"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"随机化方式：随机分配","quote_sha256":"a0b434e0929aba98b91027a87aab6b9dc58df4c52aeb8d9e9de686bf28f2cd5a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sd_random"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"对照措施：匹配安慰剂","quote_sha256":"1cafd7b3b8755010d178eb3fa7d8660de3d2c9f3a15eedfd1f8bbf4194f91a9b","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sd_control"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"对照：匹配安慰剂对照；试验组与安慰剂组按1:1随机分配，双盲治疗16周。","quote_sha256":"bcf69f1343deaa3b4cd6b8ab0fd4fbac84bf974c3118292b17999b1ba93aa172","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sd_ratio"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"分配模型：平行组（parallel assignment）\n中心模式：多中心\n试验组与对照组：试验药组；对照组","quote_sha256":"f6ab4d7fe62a86c53e5b19e8cdf8ec4e5447a121aeb024c718627763fd87a402","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sd_alloc_center"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"试验干预：试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次，连续16周；对照组接受匹配安慰剂。","quote_sha256":"f3eff5ef57b4691ff025db695140e4ead682562786c0dec621edcd256ef28af3","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sd_intervention"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"剂量与给药方案：合成试验药A：100 mg，每日一次（QD）（口服）；第1天至第16周。","quote_sha256":"4b72f3388e7586f2bc754d65df1ff638f98aed04e4f3067823942002abba8ed1","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sd_dose"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性","quote_sha256":"bae98d5756fc33d2dec389859c413b44261174683ee2abd68620571e65357c06","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sd_compliance"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sd_periods"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"8c7a570d51b842be51c8689066b3d6fe50030b8229d96708644c920d085e82c5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sd_visits"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"样本量策略：假设第16周PASI 75应答率试验组为60%、安慰剂组为30%，双侧α=0.05、把握度90%、1:1随机，并考虑15%脱落，共计划入组132例（每组66例）。","quote_sha256":"2088842f2548655845b43f017bb904dc2663a94d1a5c7a802e7adf8daa68b0d2","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sd_sample"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"样本量再估计是否计划：否\n期中分析是否计划：否","quote_sha256":"3deb9bac879bd9b7640c483aa2f9818610b5e6e19c4e8c1bbbc26a05016a1863","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sd_no_interim"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"估计目标策略：治疗策略人群为所有随机受试者；比较第16周PASI 75应答。停药或使用救援治疗按复合策略判定为无应答，其他缺失数据采用无应答填补；报告组间率差及95%置信区间。","quote_sha256":"44f71070d9cdb5b6b69ad6feeeb7fbfeef4aad105693eaa3500bedd537f18414","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sd_estimand"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"统计分析策略：全分析集按随机分组采用CMH方法比较主要终点，报告应答率差、95%置信区间和P值，以优效性为目标。主要缺失处理采用无应答填补，并以多重插补和观察病例分析进行敏感性分析；安全性集按实际治疗分析。不开展期中分析。","quote_sha256":"ccd7b348358b71793f3761994bf0e928e73abcd319f577b74f5285d5c99e3b7c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sd_stats"}],"evidence_span_ids":["s1_sec4","sd_phase_region","sd_design","sd_population","sd_inclusion","sd_random","sd_control","sd_ratio","sd_alloc_center","sd_intervention","sd_dose","sd_compliance","sd_periods","sd_visits","sd_sample","sd_no_interim","sd_estimand","sd_stats"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":17},"heading":"研究设计","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组设计的III期确证性临床研究，开发区域为中国。目标研究人群为年龄≥18岁的成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者。受试者按1:1随机分配至试验组或对照组，试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服、每日一次，对照组接受匹配安慰剂，双盲治疗16周。研究时期包括筛选期（最长4周）、双盲治疗期（16周）和安全性随访期（4周）；筛选后于基线/第1天随机，第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访；PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。依从性通过药品计数及受试者日记评价。样本量基于第16周PASI 75应答率试验组为60%、安慰剂组为30%，采用双侧α=0.05、把握度90%、1:1随机并考虑15%脱落进行估算，计划入组132例（每组66例）。本研究不计划期中分析，也不计划样本量再估计。主要疗效分析以优效性为目标，在治疗策略人群（所有随机受试者）中进行；停用研究药物或接受救援治疗的受试者按复合策略判定为无应答，其他缺失数据采用无应答填补。","rationale":"正文依据已确认研究事实：多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组III期确证性设计，开发区域为中国；人群为年龄≥18岁的成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者；试验组与对照组按1:1随机，分别接受合成试验药A 100 mg每日一次口服或匹配安慰剂，双盲治疗16周；筛选期最长4周、安全性随访期4周，第2、4、8、12、16周治疗期访视、第20周安全性随访，PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价；依从性通过药品计数及受试者日记评价；样本量、不设期中分析与样本量再估计及主要分析框架均已确认。医学作者需核对开发区域表述及访视、评价时点的呈现方式。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（研究设计）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（α、期中分析、样本量、计划入组）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_1741b1557c67abd7","section_number":"4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:8eb0d7b9830dbe758244457c","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:abb423601f76d0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:21fb7445eed9f6","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6b9f50aa913504"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:8eb0d7b9830dbe758244457c","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:8eb0d7b9830dbe758244457c","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"93840d460fbf8d92b1dbf188662859f1b30c9e2cc4ddfbbc950d117ebaef7dcf"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","text_sha256":"787313a6f081b1c9afdf03800feb1c50c317aa4aa4f0c3884e924b0594e666da"},{"locator":"section:8.4.9.2 不良事件|block:1136|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"a4dbbca5ee93dd8afdc70483dd7648214180490ccefcd4eceab6680c02415d81"},{"locator":"section:7.3.1 病例报告表的设计|block:1037|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"a081fa03f5ce0ceb2ca2444ea6b2a850997611938884f75fa4f6b5e188b3af68"},{"locator":"section:统计分析单位签字页|block:57|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:abb423601f76d0","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"288c4151aa03e0bb0feffeb19ae4b67d399ea214ab90d8f02d3dd67800bdd070"},{"locator":"section:统计分析单位签字页|block:56|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:21fb7445eed9f6","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"ce0d2dfe125632cc5d7e00e964022f9cd73382987f5a821bb4cc70694b086ad9"},{"locator":"section:研究目的和终点|block:321|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6b9f50aa913504","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"67acce9109ac9afcabc94dc949b010c17d925d27ae49d9aaf0c358c3c7d229e1"}]}